# Clash of the Eikons, {G} sorcery, "Choose one or more" (CR 700.2): all three modes, done in printed order (CR 700.2d). Bot1
# cast The Birth of Meletis on turn 1 (lore counter 1, chapter I fetched a Plains) and its draw on turn 3 added a second, so
# chapter II made the first Wall. Clash's Cactuar (3/3) fights Bot2's Steel Wall (0/4), taking 3 damage and none back; then a lore
# counter comes off the Saga (2 to 1, no chapter ability triggers: CR 714.2b), then one goes on it (1 to 2): the Saga has as many
# as chapter II's number again, with fewer before, so chapter II triggers a second time (CR 714.2c) and makes a second Wall.

